        <section id="best-practices">
            <% if(currentLang==='zh' ){ %>
                <h2>最佳实践</h2>
                <h3>幂等性</h3>
                <p>使用唯一的 <code>orderId</code> 确保每笔交易只处理一次。重复的订单号将返回
                    <code>DUPLICATE_ORDER</code> 错误。
                </p>
                <h3>Webhook 可靠性</h3>
                <p>回调可能因网络问题延迟。建议使用查询 API 主动轮询订单状态，不要仅依赖回调。</p>
                <h3>签名安全</h3>
                <p>妥善保管您的 Secret Key，不要在客户端代码中暴露。所有签名应在服务端生成和验证。</p>
                <h3>重试策略</h3>
                <p>如果请求超时或收到 5xx 错误，请在 5-10 秒后重试，最多重试 3 次。对于 4xx
                    错误，请检查请求参数后再重试。</p>
                <% } else { %>
                    <h2>Best Practices</h2>
                    <h3>Idempotency</h3>
                    <p>Use a unique <code>orderId</code> for every
                        transaction to ensure each payment is
                        processed exactly once. Duplicate order IDs
                        return a <code>DUPLICATE_ORDER</code> error.
                    </p>
                    <h3>Webhook Reliability</h3>
                    <p>Callbacks may be delayed due to network
                        issues. Always use the Query API to poll for
                        order status instead of relying solely on
                        webhooks.</p>
                    <h3>Signature Security</h3>
                    <p>Keep your Secret Key confidential — never
                        expose it in client-side code. All
                        signatures must be generated and verified
                        server-side.</p>
                    <h3>Retry Strategy</h3>
                    <p>For timeouts or 5xx errors, retry after 5–10
                        seconds with a maximum of 3 retries. For 4xx
                        errors, verify your request parameters
                        before retrying.</p>
                    <% } %>
        </section>


